<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Thank you for the meal."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hands pressed together, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I gave a proper after-meal thanks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Come to think of it, is <STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE> still not here?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the end, even after dinner was over, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> never showed up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had gone to wash the dishes, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> were drunk and asleep in the living room.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "500" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then the sliding door of the living room opened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\五島エリカ.ogg" "BGM" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール挨拶.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"The genius girl, as everyone agrees, me included, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Has arrived at the Arata settlement!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the other side of the sliding door stood an old woman in a school uniform, with twin tails.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Who is this supposed to be...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No way...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"How about it, </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="3">! Today's food was delicious, wasn't it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Which one, which one did you like best?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, uh, um..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dressed up as </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was painful on a criminal level.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This needed self-censorship.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This far gone, it wasn't an impression, or even cosplay anymore. It was a costume-party act.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Still, her gestures and way of talking were spot on.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"I sent </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> a video of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> last week, so she probably practiced with that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To copy her this well from a video sent last week, she must have practiced a lot.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール挨拶.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what do you think? My twin tails, seeing them once in a while, don't you think they're pretty nice?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">I heard you were all coming today, so I've been planning my operation the whole time!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\五島スマイル.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "12" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "20" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">With that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> spun around once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Had she really gotten a uniform and a wig ready just for this?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was knitting her brow as if she were looking at weird food.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Wrong!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the sudden shout, the room went silent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The voice belonged to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, who had sat up.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "Attack頭.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "0" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> isn't like this!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　She's quieter... and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="かれん">lovely</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">she doesn't talk in such a vulgar way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was trembling all over.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\きらーん.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s mouth twisted into a smirk.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took hair ties from her pocket, quickly put her hair in twin tails, and stood next to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテール挨拶.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Here before us is none other than </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erika Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Oh-ho? Don't tell me you're a fan of the genius girl, as everyone agrees, me included, Erina Goto?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> grinned at </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it, the two names were just one letter apart.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was Erika Niimura, if I remembered right.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール挨拶.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Why, it's Motoki-cho's genius girl, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I see, so you're afraid this Erika Goto will steal your title of genius girl, and that's why you're competing with me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> grinned at </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"As if the one and only original genius girl could have her throne threatened by a single fan!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">If you like, shall we have a showdown?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げる.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Shall we have a showdown?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed to be trying her hand at a </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> impression too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oho, challenging this genius girl Erika Goto to a showdown, you've got quite the nerve. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Very well! A showdown it is!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What on earth is this turn of events...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Wrong... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> isn't like this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, faced with reality, was on the verge of losing her reason.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Though she was the type to act on instinct to begin with.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "Attack頭.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> isn't this vulgar!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　She isn't some cheeky kid who says arrogant things like that and acts all high and mighty!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At these words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed a little miffed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The everyday </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was exactly like this, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s words amounted to rejecting her whole personality.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテール.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"What's that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Didn't the men you've met so far think the same thing about </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　All looks and nothing else, that's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so I bet the men got disillusioned, didn't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げる.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Got disillusioned, didn't they?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Wha...! What's with you, shorty!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Talking like that to a grown-up 20-year-old!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh my, you're 20?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　You sure have an old-looking face."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"An old-looking face."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "0" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">"You said the thing I worry about most...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Besides, I could tell when you hugged me earlier. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That big, puffed-up chest of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s is 97 percent padding, isn't it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Padding, isn't it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "10" "0" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Ngh...! You said the thing I worry about second most...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It looked like </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was losing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In this kind of showdown, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was strong through and through.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But badmouthing someone's chest didn't sit right with me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That kind of worry, I understand it painfully well.</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテール挨拶.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Honestly, it's so unsightly... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The old face can't be helped, I suppose, but she should just live proudly with her chest as it is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
Even Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="2"> has accepted that about herself and lives proudly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Lives proudly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what did you just say?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "Attack.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, I can't let that remark pass... 
{PAUSE ""}
Why does this turn into talk about my chest?
{PAUSE ""}
　A shrimpy nitwit numbskull like you is nowhere near ready to defy me!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sharing the same worry: </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. I had no choice but to take </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> side.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
