<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="6">, you're a girl who understands. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That's right!</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">As if I'd lose to this </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">vulgar little shrimp</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">cosplay hag</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
