<STYLE ID="1">For some reason, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was burning with rivalry against </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Probably a case of: hate the monk, and you hate his </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="けさ">robes</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too.</STYLE><PG>
