<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're on my side, right?"</STYLE>
