{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Judging by </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s manner, she had heard the conversation.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you know what we're about to do, don't you?"</STYLE>
