{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"All right, everyone, sit down. It's showdown time!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We gathered around the cleared table.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE>
