<STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Apparently we'd be having a battle royale in these pairs.</STYLE><PG>
