<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But what kind of showdown would it be?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"The showdown we're about to have was passed down by Westerners who reached the Arata settlement long ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">A showdown the Arata way, based on a time-honored tradition."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't know what kind of showdown it was, but if it meant crushing </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> here, I'd take on anything!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Here's the showdown!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
