{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">On </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s instructions, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> turned off the light in the room.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">With no streetlights outside, it was truly pitch-black, but after a few seconds, moonlight began to filter in faintly.</STYLE>
