{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">At the same time, an orange glow fell softly on </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face.</STYLE>
