{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"What we'll be doing is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">ghost stories."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ghost stories?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So, a scary-story contest?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"When one person's story is over, I draw the next paper doll. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That's how you'll take turns telling ghost stories. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">At the end, you vote with your own paper doll for whoever was scariest. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The team with the most votes wins. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Of course, voting for your own team is against the rules."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I see, so all I had to do was tell a scary story.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The usual me would be bad with this kind of story, but now that the demon of fury had possessed me, nothing could scare me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But there's a little jinx to this showdown... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
