{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Especially around a memorial service..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Don't say scary stuff like that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Only a candle lit the room, and paper dolls with names written on them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The atmosphere was perfect.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Now then... on this night before the memorial service, who would tell the scariest story...?</STYLE>
